{"html":"<p>The capstone is <strong>Pulse</strong>: a small but complete SaaS usage-analytics product.\nIt exercises everything in this course — a Rust API, a Postgres schema, a\nbackground worker, and a Next.js dashboard with HeroUI.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-it-does\">What it does</h2>\n<p>A customer signs up, gets an API key, and their application sends usage events\n(<code>api_call</code>, <code>storage_write</code>, <code>job_run</code>). Pulse:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Ingests events at high volume (<code>POST /v1/events</code>).</li>\n<li>Aggregates them per tenant per day.</li>\n<li>Serves a dashboard: MRR, active users, plan breakdown, usage this month,\nrecent invoices.</li>\n<li>Emails a monthly usage summary (background job).</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Small enough to finish, real enough to be instructive.</p>\n<h2 id=\"architecture\">Architecture</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>        ┌──────────────┐</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>        │  Customer    │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>        │  SDK / curl  │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>        └──────┬───────┘</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>               │  POST /v1/events  (API key)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>               ▼</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      ┌────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │   Rust API (axum)  │──────┐</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  auth · validate   │      │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  enqueue           │      │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      └────────┬───────────┘      │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>               │                  │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>               ▼                  ▼</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      ┌────────────────┐   ┌──────────────┐</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  Postgres      │◄──│   Worker     │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  events        │   │  aggregate   │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  aggregates    │   │  email       │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  jobs          │   │  reaper      │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      └────────┬───────┘   └──────────────┘</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>               │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>               │  GET /v1/dashboard  (session)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>               ▼</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      ┌────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  Next.js + HeroUI      │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  sticky header · nav   │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      │  cards · table · chart │</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>      └────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"the-four-pieces\">The four pieces</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Piece</th>\n<th>Tech</th>\n<th>Module</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>API</td>\n<td>Rust, axum 0.8, sqlx, tokio</td>\n<td>04.02, 04.03</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Worker</td>\n<td>Rust, tokio, Postgres queue</td>\n<td>04.04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Database</td>\n<td>Postgres 16 + migrations</td>\n<td>04.03</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dashboard</td>\n<td>Next.js App Router, Tailwind v4, HeroUI v3</td>\n<td>05.03</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"schema\">Schema</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"sql\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"sql\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A73